: TRANSCRIBED, NOT CAPTURED. The /events connect dump a Glasscalibur v2.1.0 (ESPHome 2026.6.5) would send,
: written from components/web_server/web_server.cpp at that tag (docs/remote-edition.md section 5). The weaker
: form of a contract check: it catches the model disagreeing with this reading, not the reading being wrong.
: A capture from a real unit replaces it on the bench. Stored LF; the test sends it CRLF, as the server does.
